{
  "label": "undeservedfuture9",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label undeservedfuture9:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast1.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And remember, Hima-chan — no talking about the Cold War around Uncle Geoffrey. He’s at an age now where we can’t be riling him up like that.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, Mom. Though, I’m not quite sure what sort of girl you see me as if this is something you need to warn me about first thing in the morning.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m only doing it now because I know your father won’t and because some of us have jobs that we need to go to today.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast2.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All you do is tell people to stay away from sugar while I am expected to nurture the mind of someone smarter than me. It’s like high school all over again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m pretty sure that’s the point, Dad. I guess at least now you get to do it from the comfort of your own home, though.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m pretty sure Ayane could do her job from home too if she wasn’t so focused on being the best nutritionist she can be.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, what do you do that couldn’t be handled over a Zoom call? Why do you need to go to an office?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe she’s having an affair.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you having an affair, Ayane? Is it because I’m not sad anymore?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast3.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, Akira. Sadness is so ingrained into your personality that you still exude it even when everything is going perfectly.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The reason I’m having an affair is because you’re boring.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She makes a good point, Dad. I don’t think there’s much you can do about that this late into life either. I think you’ve just gotta let her go.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh well. It’s been a good run. See you in court for the custody battle, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do either of you want pancakes? I figured I’d pack some up for my secret work-boyfriend before I leave.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast4.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You must not like him that much then. Reheated pancakes are the worst. If he was a real threat, he’d be sitting at the table with us right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll take some pancakes, Mom.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not until you finish your omelet, you won’t.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast5.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why did you even ask then?...",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Himawari, are you still able to go to the store with me today? We need to pick up a few things for Geoffrey’s stay.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast6.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And under no circumstance should you forget the hair glue, life vest, or bicycle pump! I promised him that all of these things would be readily available.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll also need your help remembering the laundry list of absurd items that this man requires for some reason.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I can come. What else do I have going on? I’m a stay-at-home daughter now.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You sure they're going to be open, though? I thought everything was closed on New Year’s?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Only one way to find out.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Works for me. I haven’t set foot outside in three days, though. So I’m going to need you to hold an umbrella over my head to protect me from the sun so I don’t burst into flames.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can catch fire together. That way, everyone will know we’re related.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not in Kumon-mi anymore, Akira. You no longer have to worry about what people will think when they see you with a teenage girl.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This some sort of PTSD thing from back when you were a cradle-robbing bimbo, Dad?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast7.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably. Eat your omelet. Pretend the eggs come from a salmon or something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You haven’t touched yours either. You holding out for the pancakes too?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’ll cave soon enough. She always does.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast8.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You two are lucky you’re the center of my world, you know. Because at this rate, my secret boyfriend isn’t going to get any and I’ll need to start a new affair when he dumps me.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or you could just stay loyal to the man who uprooted his entire life to start over with you in Aomori.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know, Dad. It’s really starting to sound like you only relocated to get away from the, like...fifty other Moms who were trying to make babies with you at the same time.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast9.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, so anyway, that’s a topic we probably shouldn’t bring up at the breakfast table. Or any time during Geoffrey’s stay, for that matter.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Got it, got it. Extramarital affairs — in. Babies — out. Can we still talk about your harem, though? Was Aunt Sana a part of it?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think she still is, Himawari.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I knew it. I’m gonna give that lady a piece of my mind the next time I need her to buy alcohol for me. Nobody pines after my dad and gets away with it! He’s a married man!",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mom’s allowed to have as many boyfriends as she wants, though. Pretty sure that’s what womens’ suffrage was all about.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, something like that. I’m glad to see your homeschooling is working out.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahah......",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast10.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that her now? Aunt Sana? Give me the phone. I’ve got some choice words for her about what kinds of men she should go after! I won’t sit idly by as someone tries to tear this family apart!",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Himawari, quiet. I haven’t even started to-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that my niece I hear over there? Good morning, Hima-chan! How are you doing?!",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast11.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ......................",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast12.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s the matter, Dad? Forget the sound of my voice already?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ..................................",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast13.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right. Sorry. Forgot I’m not supposed to call you that anymore. Ayane doesn’t like it.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How about...Sensei, then? For old time’s sake.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": .................................",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. That shocked, huh? Or are you just banned from talking to me altogether now?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s fine, I guess. Either way, guess who’s in Aomori for the next few nights?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Want to meet up for dinner or something? Secretly, of course. Wouldn’t want your wife catching wind of you having any sort of tie to the past, after all.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast14.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, and bring Hima-chan along too! It’s been forever since I last saw her. She must be so tall now.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast15.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ................................",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Akira? Who is it?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not a debt collector again, is it? I could have sworn I learned from my mistakes and set up autopay on everything after the last time.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dad? You’re not going to faint again, are you?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": .............",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you are, try to fall this way. I’m in a better position to catch you than Mom is.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast16.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Akira?...You’re scaring me. I don’t like this.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast17.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ........................",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, I really don’t like this.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast18.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...hello?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hima-chan! You remember my voice, don’t you?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast19.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aunt Ami! Hey! I’m so glad you’re not a debt collector!",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast20.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m pretty sure you’re not supposed to be calling, though. Mom and Dad both look pretty shook right now.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I won’t be long. Just wanted to let your father know I’m going to be in Aomori for a few days.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast21.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? How come?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Inspiration, I guess. I try to follow the seasons these days and I’ve heard you guys are in for a few weeks of snow. ",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, it’s really coming down over here. The trains are super delayed. You’re not driving, are you?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am. The roads aren’t as bad as you’d expect, though. Have they been plowed near you guys yet?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Himawari...hang up the phone.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, Aunt Ami. I’ve gotta go. It’s nice hearing from you, though. I hope you have fun in Aomori.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, Hima-chan. Can I talk to your mom first? Just for a second.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast22.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She wants to talk to you. Is that okay?",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fine. Hand me the phone.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hooray! It’s been so long since I last heard my best friend’s voice. I imagine it’s just as beautiful as the last time we-",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast23.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There. Problem solved.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. Not even a trace of hesitation. Stone cold, Mom. Stone cold.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You guys really fell out hard, didn’t you? You used to be so close. And it still seems like Aunt Ami wants to-",
