    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast24.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast24"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Our lives are better without her, Himawari. Plus, just look at what her voice did to your father. It’s obvious we’d want no part of that, isn’t it?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess. I still don’t really get it, though. She’s always been so nice to me.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good. Because if anyone is ever not nice to you, I will murder them and hang their corpse on our front porch. Ami is no exception to that. Family or not.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re kind of scary when it comes to protecting us, Mom. Like some kind of lion. The blonde just adds to that.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It almost makes me forget about that time you hit Dad.",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hima-chan, be a good girl and eat your fucking omelet before Geoffrey-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene breakfast25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast25.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wha- already? He didn’t take the Lamborghini, did he? In this weather?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yay! Old person!",
      "spk": "Himawari",
