      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast26.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll get it!",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay! But don’t let him bring his bags in himself, even if he’s a champion bodybuilder!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your father is strong for his age too and he’ll help him once he remembers how to function as a human! You set up the guest room already, right?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yup! Water-bed and all! It’ll be like he’s right back at home! I promise!",
      "spk": "Himawari",
      "spkColor": "#3CCBFA",
      "zh": ""
