      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just wish I got some kind of warning beforehand. That way, I could have prepared myself and at least figured out what to say ahead of time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I believe that warning comes in the form of one’s name appearing on your phone before answering it- my dear, senile husband.",
