      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast30.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast30"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, what do you want to do? Because it’s not like I’m going to outright ban you from seeing your family. I just...don’t want her influencing our daughter.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
