      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She sounds more...uhh...stable than I remember.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I’d sure hope so. She’s had fifteen years to get her shit together. I don’t think she’d last long going around threatening dismemberment as a fully-grown adult.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you wouldn’t feel weird if I got dinner with her? Just...to see how she is now?",
