      "img": "游戏图片/Events/breakfast31.webp",
      "alt": "breakfast31"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want the honest answer or the one I give you to make you feel better?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Honest. You’re the love of my life and I don’t want to do anything that’ll make you uncomfortable. Especially since-",
